#: templates/publishing/checks.html:8
msgid "Only fictional test data may be used. If enabled and authorised, the title and abstract below are sent to OpenAI, including any personal information they contain. No files or separate reviewer records are sent. API use may incur charges. Provider retention may apply; disabling response storage does not guarantee zero retention."
